# Engineering contract

Follow root **`CURSOR.md`** for execution, validation, DoD, developer actions, and task lifecycle.

Completion reports: use structured `RunCompletionSummary` — canonical shape in `packages/completion-report/src/types.ts`, section registry/validation in `packages/completion-report/src/completion-report-contract.ts` (also `@songara/pwa-base/completion-report`). Do not redefine report sections in prompts. Human guide: `docs/guides/run-report-standard.md` (Milestone 1 refreshes prose still mentioning the removed telemetry service).

When UI changes: run `pnpm capture:artifacts` (no-op guidance stub in PWA-Base after T0.4) and describe Visual Validation. Markdown is export-only.
